cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use StorageDump, please cite it as below."
title: "StorageDump"
abstract: "StorageDump is a free, open-source Chrome extension that inspects and exports everything a website stores in your browser — cookies (including HttpOnly and partitioned), localStorage, sessionStorage, IndexedDB, Cache Storage and service workers — as lossless JSON or ZIP, entirely on your machine."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Enes"
    family-names: "Öztürk"
version: "0.2.1"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/nsozturk/storagedump"
url: "https://nsozturk.github.io/storagedump/"
keywords: [chrome-extension, cookies, localstorage, indexeddb, cache-storage, browser-storage, devtools]
